so:
    Read policy hints for DB scan and point paths.
    These options stay Wrela-owned and can be mapped to runtime controls.

A ReadOptions:
    has:
        mutable max_point_in_flight: Integer = 64
        mutable max_range_in_flight: Integer = 8
        mutable range_limit: Integer = 100
        mutable is_interactive: Boolean = true

to default_read_options() -> ReadOptions:
    return A ReadOptions()
